### Variables
@baseUrl = https://v02.medintl.info/admin-api
@authToken = YOUR_AUTH_TOKEN_HERE

### 1. Sync All Products
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
X-Allow-Self-Signed-Certificates: true

{
  "query": "mutation SyncAllProducts { syncAllEntitiesToCms(entityType: \"Product\") { success totalEntities successCount errorCount message errors { entityId error } } }"
}

###

### 2. Sync All Variants
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "query": "mutation SyncAllVariants { syncAllEntitiesToCms(entityType: \"ProductVariant\") { success totalEntities successCount message } }"
}
















### 变量设置
# 注意：文档明确指出域名是 rest.yakkyofy.com
@baseUrl=https://rest.yakkyofy.com
@apiKey=80da0b23-31c5-4462-a9ac-0800efbe5ef7

### 1. 验证 API Key (通过获取订单列表测试)
# 即使你没有订单，这个接口如果返回 200 (空数组) 就说明 Key 正确
# 如果返回 401，说明 Key 错了
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 2. 创建测试订单 (核心测试)
# 请务必替换 sku 为你 Yakkyofy 后台 Import List 里的真实 SKU
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "externalId": "LOCAL-VENDURE-TEST-001",
    "note": "Test order from local Vendure",
    "shippingData": {
        "name": "Mario Rossi",
        "address": "Via Roma 1",
        "city": "Rome",
        "zipcode": "00100",
        "phone": "+390000000000",
        "country": "Italy",
        "countryCode": "IT",
        "province": "Rome",
        "provinceCode": "RM"
    },
    "items": [
        {
            "sku": "YK22010000621-0", 
            "quantity": 1,
            "externalId": "LINE-ITEM-001"
        }
    ],
    "cod": false,
    "pricing": {
        "product": 10,
        "shipping": 5,
        "other": 0
    }
}